    "preamble": "Sumesh Kumar Singh Deo vs The State Of Jharkhand on 15 January, 2016 Author: H. C. Mishra",
    "facts": "The petitioner is apprehending his arrest in connection with G.O. Case No.208 of 2014, for the alleged offences under Sections 26(i), 2(i), 27, 48 and 59(iii) of Food Safety and Standard Act. Petitioner is the owner of a hotel and he has been made accused in this case for using haldi powder of a particular brand, which was found to be unsafe. It is admitted by both the parties that haldi powder was being used in the food prepared in the hotel of the petitioner.",
